// Type definitions for FrogJS 0.9
//
// The FrogJS globals (console, process, Buffer, timers, require, ...) and its
// built-in modules: `require('fs')`, `import http = require('http')`, ...
//
// These describe FrogJS, not Node.js: where FrogJS differs (for example `fs`
// callbacks get error strings and `Stats.isFile` is a boolean), the types
// follow FrogJS. Don't combine them with @types/node; see types/README.md.

